  "solution": {
    "text": "Let the first term of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>.</mo><mi>P</mi><mo>.</mo></math>&nbsp;is <math><mi>&#8216;</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>&#8217;</mi></math> and&nbsp;the common difference is <math><mi>&#8216;</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>&#8217;</mi></math>.<br /><math><mo>&#8756;</mo><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><msub><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mi>i</mi></mfenced></math><br />and <math><msub><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>6</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>48</mn></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>16</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>i</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><mo>&#8756;</mo></math> From <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>i</mi><mi>i</mi><mo>)</mo></math>, <math><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>22</mn></math> <math><mo>&#38;</mo></math> <math><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>12</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8756;</mo><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><msub><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>(</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>9</mn><mi>d</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>22</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>9</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>12</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>320</mn></math>"
